						<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
					<meta name="Description" content="It keeps generating places like towns, houses, and cities. I don't want that. I want the ability to generate other types of locations after creating a city, such as forests, dungeons, or other areas. Having the entire story take place in the same location is starting to get boring.">
			
	<meta name="twitter:site" content="@steam" />

