					<meta property="og:description" content="It keeps generating places like towns, houses, and cities. I don't want that. I want the ability to generate other types of locations after creating a city, such as forests, dungeons, or other areas. Having the entire story take place in the same location is starting to get boring.">
					<meta property="twitter:description" content="It keeps generating places like towns, houses, and cities. I don't want that. I want the ability to generate other types of locations after creating a city, such as forests, dungeons, or other areas. Having the entire story take place in the same location is starting to get boring.">
			
	
