			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_572679770568946672">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c572679490124303476">AI Roguelite: AI-generated RPG</a></b>:</div>Expanded map/locations in general is prioritized highly; rough ETA about 1 month </blockquote><br>Thank you so much for responding! Your presence here means a lot to the community.<br><br><b>To make things much easier for you, I have started a centralized Megathread here:</b><br><a class="bb_link" href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5103870/discussions/0/572679490124313468/" target="_blank" rel="" >Click here to view the Megathread</a><br><br>Since there are quite a few duplicate discussions popping up, I took the liberty of pointing players from connected threads over to this central post so they can share their bug reports, findings, and engine limitations there. I really hope having all this structured data in one single discussion helps you pinpoint what needs tweaking for the upcoming update!			</div>
