								<div class="forum_topic_name" title="Based on my ~6 hours playtime I would like to suggest:

- A thank you to dev for making this fun game ːcatgirlloveː
- Increase mod support ːcrosout_rideː to accept more edits. For example, making a custom stats or level up rules now requires to manually change game json. 
